Problems I ran into while developing this application and how I solved them
* learned how to utilize pagination to turn a long list of items into multiple smaller, easy to browse, pages of items.
* converted a mongodb database into a mysql one. First I exported my mongodb db as a csv file then I imported it into a mysql db using a "LOAD DATA" sql query.
* had to make multiple additional tables, one for carts and one for cart items.
* integrated Stripe payments and learned how to handle receiving webhooks